      "descriptionEn": "Access to backup systems, copies and restoration is restricted according to protection needs and separated from ordinary user access. Administrative activity remains traceable; authorised necessary restoration avoids preventable emergency obstacles. Protection against alteration, deletion and common compromise aligns with p36. Immutable storage is one possible safeguard, not by itself proof of effective backup.",
