      "descriptionEn": "Reportability is assessed under each applicable regime using its own criteria. Personal data involvement alone does not automatically trigger every authority notification. Uncertainty is promptly investigated and escalated; sufficient findings must not be delayed by waiting for certainty. Decision, basis and times feed the p31 reporting process.",
