      "descriptionEn": "External labels are used only for their respective purposes. Traffic Light Protocol (TLP) describes sharing boundaries, not incident severity. Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) measures vulnerability severity, not the actual incident directly. Required reporting schemas are supported without claiming universal one-to-one conversion between all models.",
