      "descriptionEn": "Strategic exit decisions identify triggers, alternatives, dependencies, realistic duration and acceptable transition risks. Barriers such as proprietary formats, licence rights and lack of replacement capacity are assessed and treated. p42-c11 provides operational implementation and evidence; this policy does not create a second conflicting exit plan. More extensive DORA requirements remain applicable within scope.",
