      "descriptionEn": "Material subcontractor dependencies are traced where relevant to risk, particularly shared platforms and difficult-to-replace services. Transparency, change and security requirements are agreed with direct counterparties. NIS2 does not impose an individual approval right for every tier of every supply chain. Processing on behalf of a controller follows the specific or general written authorisation rules in p42-c07.",
