      "descriptionEn": "Owners track relevant legal and contractual changes through p04 and assess effects on specific supplier relationships. Binding duties, recommendations and drafts are distinguished. Necessary adjustments have an owner, actual application deadline and evidence; changing standard wording alone does not close gaps in existing contracts. Inapplicable rules do not trigger automatic changes.",
