      "descriptionEn": "Methodology and effectiveness are reviewed at planned intervals and following significant changes or supplier incidents. Review considers missing transparency, incorrect assumptions, concentration and overdue actions. p42-c16 maintains consistency of the operational policy. CIR-covered entities additionally follow the at-least-annual review of risk assessment and treatment plans under 2.1.4; this does not require annual rewriting of every supplier policy.",
